This is the first post. It exists to prove the content pipeline works: Keystatic writes the file locally, the reader picks it up, the page renders.

## What this site is

A place to think in public. Mostly notes on building things and lessons from operating them. Occasionally fiction.

## What comes next

Design, then content. For now it builds and it deploys, which is enough to start writing.
